 nkolé\n- Charlotte Rampling\n- Anya Taylor-Joy\n- Robert Pattinson\n- Jav
 ier Bardem\n- Nakoa-Wolf Momoa\n- Ida Brooke\n\n\nL'empereur Paul Atraides
